{"format":"local-vault-ai-portable-chunks-v1","version":1,"chunks":[{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Demosaicing.md::0","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Demosaicing.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"demosaicing demosaicing","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Demosaicing.md","fileName":"Demosaicing.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Demosaicing","heading":"Document","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"2026-09-16 00:47\n\nStatus: #baby\n\nTags: [[Camera Sensor and Synthetic Image Forensics]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Camera Sensor and Synthetic Image Forensics","Color Filter Array","fakephotos.epub"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Demosaicing.md::1","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Demosaicing.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"demosaicing demosaicing","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Demosaicing.md","fileName":"Demosaicing.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Demosaicing","heading":"Demosaicing","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"Demosaicing reconstructs a full red-green-blue image from the single-channel samples recorded through a [[Color Filter Array]]. For each location, the camera retains the measured channel and estimates the two missing channels from nearby values according to its interpolation algorithm.\n\nThis process means that roughly two-thirds of displayed color values are computed rather than directly sensed. The resulting periodic relationships can identify a camera-processing pipeline and can be disrupted when an editor replaces or transforms a region.","tags":["baby"],"links":["Camera Sensor and Synthetic Image Forensics","Color Filter Array","fakephotos.epub"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Demosaicing.md::2","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Demosaicing.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"demosaicing demosaicing","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Demosaicing.md","fileName":"Demosaicing.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Demosaicing","heading":"References","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"[[fakephotos.epub]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Camera Sensor and Synthetic Image Forensics","Color Filter Array","fakephotos.epub"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""}]}